      "text": "A flash loop borrows MUSD, swaps it to BTC, posts that BTC as collateral, and repays the flash loan in the same transaction. Pylon sizes it against the one hundred and fifty percent collateral floor, then prices every leg and the exact debt delta the signature authorises.",
