    {
      "id": "s6_proof",
      "text": "And it has run. Fourteen explorer-linked transactions: reserve deposits, loops, an unwind, a full exit, and an autonomous keeper that defended a shielded position from one hundred and seventy-two back to one hundred and eighty-one percent. The audited generation is live on mainnet too, funded with real MUSD.",
